      "id": "claim_5137f84b36be4cd59aa0cf6c902aa4f2",
      "statement": "agent/dashboard/__init__.py exposes the router lazily via a PEP 562 __getattr__ so that importing a dashboard submodule does not drag in routes.py, FastAPI, and every API/job module; only the webapp that mounts the router pays that import cost.",
