      "statement": "Every dashboard mutation is guarded by the router-level require_same_origin_for_mutations dependency, which passes GET/HEAD/OPTIONS and bearer-token-only requests but rejects cookie-authenticated mutations whose Origin/Referer is not allowed; WebSockets always receive the origin check.",
